    "summary": "The packet's diff is empty (0 files), so I reviewed the fix already at HEAD 7850da1. I did not run the tests, and I did not read the daemon.py refusal-reason reset or the steering_tick call site in full. decision_log.recent (decision_log.py:266) returns at once for empty subjects and honours limit per subject. It marks a subject complete after limit rows and stops at GROUPED_SCAN_LIMIT lines scanned, applied rows or not. safe_scope (steering_policy.py:29) returns the entries unchanged when no worktree is known, with no cwd fallback. daemon.py resets steering_refusal_reasons to None at lines 1659 and 1730, which is consistent with the reset outside active mode. No blocking issues found.",
